{"unit_id":"awaYFawa__dsh-plugins-folders#card-zh","repo":"awaYFawa/dsh-plugins-folders","commit":"050340c1416499a5f216ab136bf3ea723f0bb8bf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugins Folders 是面向 DSH Web 插件页的管理面板：它在 shell.overlay 中添加可拖动入口，并读取已安装插件清单。用户可以创建文件夹、整理和排序插件，单独或整组启停，也能搜索、批量移动并撤销操作；卸载记录支持按原安装来源重装。适合需要整理较多 DSH 插件的用户。分组与记录保存在浏览器本地；重启 Harness 功能适用于 Windows。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:265","client.js:1198","client.js:1401","client.js:2772","index.js:122"]}
{"unit_id":"awaYFawa__dsh-plugins-folders#card-en","repo":"awaYFawa/dsh-plugins-folders","commit":"050340c1416499a5f216ab136bf3ea723f0bb8bf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Plugins Folders adds a draggable panel to the DSH Web Plugins page. Group and reorder installed plugins, toggle one or a whole folder, search, batch move, and undo. Uninstall records support reinstalling from the saved source. Data stays in browser storage; Harness restart is for Windows.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:265","client.js:1198","client.js:1401","client.js:2772","index.js:122"]}
